GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In early summer, Migfox (#65) marched into Kaluga from Khalturin to defend 
Kaluga against its would-be conquerors.
  In late summer, Tlazolteotl (#88) rode her flying armies into the Io Sea.  
Tlazolteotl's forces conquered the Io Sea without any major battles.
  In fall, Tlazolteotl rode her flying armies into Moongard.
  A conquering horde owing their allegiance to Prometeo (#5) invaded the 
province of Moongard, a Mountain area owned by 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0).  Tarsus (#43) commanded the attacking 
armies.  The defenders were commanded by Tlazolteotl (#88).
  In early summer, Alain (#33) flew over to Katmai.
  In late summer, Alain flew into Khalturin.
  In fall, Alain rode his flying armies over to Katmai.


Kingdom of Prometeo (#5):
  In spring, in Shasta, Prometeo (#5) brought to bay the provincial Eagle 
chieftain.  Prometeo commanded the invading armies.  The defenders were 
commanded by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  Although Prometeo's host were 
victorious, the provincial Eagle chieftain rallied its men and decided to 
contest Shasta.
  In spring, Tarsus (#43) rode his flying armies over to Orielle.
  In early summer, Tarsus flew over to Shasta.
  Prometeo (#5) ordered an invasion force into the Mountain province of 
Shasta, owned by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  Tarsus (#43) was in 
command of the invading armies.  The defenders were led by the provincial 
Eagle chieftain.  Although Tarsus's forces were victorious, the provincial 
Eagle chieftain regrouped its men and prepared to contest Shasta.

  In late summer, in Shasta, Prometeo (#5) brought to bay the forces of the 
provincial Eagle chieftain.  Tarsus (#43) was in command of the attacking 
armies.  The defenders were led by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  Tarsus's 
campaign accomplished the conquest of Shasta.
  From Adele:  In fall, Tarsus flew into Moongard.
  A conquering horde owing their allegiance to Prometeo (#5) invaded the 
province of Moongard, a Mountain area owned by 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0).  Tarsus (#43) commanded the attacking 
armies.  The defenders were commanded by Tlazolteotl (#88).  The armies were 
drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

